                <pb facs="0314" n="186" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg186"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">A list of the ports where there are comparatively more
                        Chinese subjects of the exempt classes to come to or through the United
                        States</hi>.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Asia;</hi> Hong-Kong, China; Saigon, Anam; Bangkok, Siam;
                    Ceylon, India; Manila, Philippine Islands.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Oceanica:</hi> Sydney, Australia; Melbourne, Australia;
                    Honolulu, Sandwich Islands.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">North America:</hi> Victoria, British Columbia.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">South America:</hi> Panama, United States of Colombia;
                    Aspinwall, United States of Colombia: Iquique, Chili.</p>
            </div>
